#: scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13ccb4b0fe50a0b6493b25b2c0954e1f488233c4d486a99c96cb89f62c9bd9fc
#. default-sha256: 60b507327e0b77923197f5be2e5a0ef6b79073ad4c46af8ff8d32810cbd40e28
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C8B44013_7895_44FA_9FF0_BEBF7A098390"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Come over here, "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫——到我身边来，"
"⟪k:15⟫吉赛儿。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab9c667590e637891bf7942441b3f84b01c7174eff999eda728a37c72503fef7
#. default-sha256: f70dcb2418df25063385d86fe219db619b2e910a2503f968d82ddb9cb9f7e471
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5388316_4AF8_41FF_BB94_D906752DB5B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫O... ⟪k:1⟫Okay... ⟪k:2⟫Um, ⟪k:3⟫may I ask why you asked me here so late at night, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……哎⟪k:1⟫……请问……⟪k:2⟫有事要吩咐吗？⟪k:3⟫老爷……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫都那么晚了……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: faf888c83cd4ba984f4589bc709137c83df104e278415905e461d6542c5e50d0
#. default-sha256: 0085410e0990d55c3d7722a527543f32a2916a9f6dcb529df9292768116091f2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F83B6FA4_0A4D_4D32_AEB8_FE729D14BBE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh, I just wanted to have a little chat.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Care for some wine? ⟪k:3⟫Come closer, and "
"I’ll pour you a glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫没什么，⟪k:1⟫就是想和你说说话而已。⟪k:2⟫来，已经给你倒了一杯葡萄酒。⟪k:3⟫来，再走近些。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5fb6be4f4bc2cc7b46581fc0b62bfb94e15b29d62bc57dcbe1f500a146d7275
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_18808066_6C70_4776_9EFA_3988B0B129ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5de78bab3d2ba30696d4ba2ccdf6408134aecce73c83717f753b73792b9b531
#. default-sha256: 1dd358b85b2c399d16f5d9fc3e39aacdfa2153a3819ad9465afe54be1bbf071d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8AB286F4_8870_4659_A866_54B3342727A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had this wine imported from up north.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They use very hard water, and like it "
"rather tart,⟪k:3⟫so it leaves quite the lasting impression on your tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这葡萄酒是从北方运来的，⟪k:1⟫入口的酸味浓郁到舌尖都麻痹。⟪k:2⟫而且，还残留着酿造原水的硬度。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd5fb1e868498f6e37da8161a63a0962bee072ac317a872c065d331fb82006d5
#. default-sha256: 7c952ab020234c47afc90c653101bed5263690e560083479c5dc4ab035f99dfe
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6F031789_319B_41C4_A3D0_31783B92DEAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And yet, it goes down so easily, you just can’t seem to stop.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What do you say? Have "
"a sip."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但没想到的是，⟪k:1⟫这酒入口后却意外的顺溜。⟪k:2⟫怎么样，⟪k:3⟫想尝尝吗？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60a84628abf40da5907c099c1d1febde691e4f06183b678c80e6b11fb1bb8bc0
#. default-sha256: d06394cab83669bbccc93c4b1ea8082af359df458744b440ffd21a98983e12c4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A7DB3716_4125_4953_BB80_3B1AF5ACE8B9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or does your expertise as a trader allow you to evaluate a wine’s quality without tasting it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫还是说……⟪k:1⟫因为你以前是经商人家的姑娘，⟪k:2⟫所以品都不需要品，⟪k:3⟫就能看出酒的优劣？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ffe94dc70712c08042b70b061b6d2bdb3319820de5505875179c344a68b4512
#. default-sha256: bf09c84628bcd34a273f73977ae81ecee3af7b12aaf117a7e94a1f33259dff50
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C73D6E2D_87A0_47AF_BE31_7FCC39A15642"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫but... ⟪k:3⟫um..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不、⟪k:1⟫并非……⟪k:2⟫如此。⟪k:3⟫但是……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6566013f27d0e93445dd1758d5f22f0eda2fed0e7b6d69e7a05d95c738feb4d
#. default-sha256: 6047799ae42a5b7fdcc2183f68dc9831eecaf253aa7860ac29f7ea26d56c38c2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_988676CC_0FEF_4F82_A1C3_81EED898432F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, Giselle, don’t trample all over my good graces."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫拜托了，吉赛儿，⟪k:1⟫可别回绝我的一番好意啊。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 401149b5c1de3f7b4f8596cc9f8e71c607d90fc71c59b954b525c6f2ee939e2e
#. default-sha256: fea0fcf33e55dd0f0402490645fb74a865a03d36ff2da29ca20ff66177087a04
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8FF9D03C_FD00_4C86_9660_B0BB6807D97A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Very well then... ⟪k:1⟫I will have a sip, Master, but no more..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那么……⟪k:1⟫就只喝一小口。⟪k:2⟫老爷……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23bcfd10dd65041fd5d2c7c83cb82fbcc4ad48c1db6d575d8b5dcb16faa9258e
#. default-sha256: f9578a41e677f1398337f611d6461ad7464fbe3f400365fa832e71953cb78a1c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD377B5C_4C16_4F8E_BA4C_429CA91945C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Have you ever considered growing out your hair?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我说，⟪k:3⟫你不打算留长头发吗？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7d47ac7a045c46b5863b55a7decac8cecb4b7794dbfe2ffaef6817d76f75f7e
#. default-sha256: 6ad88ab76e4ec3cb6bd1bfe5c6d1a418c44bfd9e141d17c7ef48683420e016b4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E29F143B_F382_48F0_B4F1_ABBC8CB3E7D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Having long hair made it difficult to do my job..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这个……⟪k:1⟫如此一来会妨碍到工作……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 930e5eefd2211a439efb0c28f719e3309c447fbf52ebb48fc9bc8b8b20352ee8
#. default-sha256: 26eb11cbfe48f3504dc9dd4edccb6093c86abd57ebfda00668dbb0e4cf4958c5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7A48ED1_2448_4AA8_BF6E_80046D9F0894"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not a merchant anymore, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You deserve to look like the woman you truly "
"are."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你现在已经不是商贩了。⟪k:1⟫我倒觉得，⟪k:2⟫女性还是留长头发才好啊。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7779ac9f36fb1d3d5e58a922e5c151054f534cf49300418c2beb63854cdc89cc
#. default-sha256: 7f3dcad3cf1d86a2ba5c076b631fbc7e5629e27df51ca2e54dc09f7414150635
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51F857EE_CF8D_433B_AEBB_2377099F1CDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I have no doubt longer hair would accentuate your natural beauty.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a gorgeous "
"shade of black, so deep a man could get lost in it for years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫你想啊，只有一头长发才能衬出你的美貌。⟪k:1⟫更加之这乌黑的色泽。⟪k:2⟫就像把一切包容在长发里一"
"样，⟪k:3⟫多么的深邃动人。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5fb6be4f4bc2cc7b46581fc0b62bfb94e15b29d62bc57dcbe1f500a146d7275
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A3506C29_38F8_464A_82EC_9F7720D62ABB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1d4d9b0ab54d7c901472e743f19549aacbc427d7128cfb8a0c5418ca8b5e099
#. default-sha256: cf7bddaa1ece23d8e6e0ad0fc689e9c87f69e3b3611e1661f9c6f14ed07d9364
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8234106F_9681_42D8_AB1E_2BE5080A332D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would contrast the color of your skin fabulously.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Highlight your eyes, your "
"cheekbones, your nape, your shoulders, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and your chest..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那一定，⟪k:1⟫能很好地映衬出你光滑的肌肤……⟪k:2⟫从你那双眼睛、⟪k:3⟫到侧脸、⟪k:4⟫再到头颈、⟪k:5⟫"
"肩膀、⟪k:6⟫最后到那胸口——⟪k:7⟫肯定都会呼之欲出吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a077d369f9106fe1f45eaa9aed27a173df88bc7a097517d257ba050308e0602
#. default-sha256: c8731ae648b83ff2d40eb6cc6de33124736b62122c79225cfd288c380e40dfd7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D2FD3556_C1A3_4F2A_81E3_6CBC62DF2171"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Um, I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I should get going..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那个、⟪k:1⟫我……我、⟪k:2⟫差不多该……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f01e3309ee9e4e1bc6f9da0a6cbe8431f2c70747d4a8ab1f44114d4e79cd382
#. default-sha256: bc909bed51dd8aaefebe8cdbe6c95850e29f71c591798cc167d432d229aca797
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DB5B0621_8AA1_4961_A98A_6A15D6B839D1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, but we’re not done talking yet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……我们的谈话不是还没结束吗……？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 285a5e9dd41611ece3e03443dced5adc56cfe45616f83616efeafdf00290db49
#. default-sha256: ad7fb5c564a3537765ba2da45f1a1c5c7351190e544573cb98cdd0ef0a23683d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C3E82633_B0DB_460B_93C9_4993811BDD30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫I would not want a lack of sleep to interfere with my ability to work tomorrow. "
"⟪k:2⟫Thank you very much for the wine. It was delicio—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不、不……⟪k:1⟫不能耽搁明天的工作。⟪k:2⟫非……⟪k:3⟫非常感谢您的葡萄酒。⟪k:4⟫真的非常美味——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d10385ffc70100f851b57f2591e2e45e4bd49ef75a37b38a20222319bde0b004
#. default-sha256: 35866b649be372ec158fdc221f4e11a65300817fa970a6a0fc3cee6e98c63ebb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0FD4CDAC_9BFD_4255_88F5_B730FD725252"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫—?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫………呜！？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd59520556ef7a40ce4f48fa809ebf974202bfff93ececbae80ab3aec898c80f
#. default-sha256: a64b8781fd5afb0ef7ef887260af990ab885dfe1ae32bb4d0179087a072e6cb5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E38D7149_9007_43BB_A07F_2B215C0405B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so cold-hearted, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From the moment I first laid eyes on you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不要这么冷淡无情嘛。⟪k:1⟫我从第一眼看到你开始，就……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8831e4498dd5e0e15470c3e8ed27ac389f859f5ae5801a02e47d8c3043a7f949
#. default-sha256: a5b164d8dc91865262157284d82c13cfef75bfc0c43c15dceaf67eb0b05e5da7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F32900D5_D993_4CBA_AEB0_00311E14B013"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫M— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That’s enough fooling around for one night!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫老——⟪k:1⟫老爷！⟪k:2⟫请、⟪k:3⟫请不要再拿我开玩笑了……呜！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 911601233a3d9b18b3f0696d3ead14cb398c5a6e4c0050c3fea3f6010d839a82
#. default-sha256: 00c6e887428bb4b592331d63fb36ad417759110680e593c8f1fe9d07a1b286e8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CF3E08F_D21D_4EA6_9D48_C90792B0C8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, now, don’t be afraid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wouldn’t do anything to hurt you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I simply "
"want to express my love."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫别害怕啊。⟪k:1⟫我又……⟪k:2⟫不会对你做什么坏事。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫就让我——来疼爱你吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a073c9a58a0c10bedbbd05e3d0d2b1c762aebaf87d05d2e95f6a7dd7d3dccf13
#. default-sha256: 350cdf132ed92097e4bbe8aef1559dfdcac169b9d01cef664046c995747ab617
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_695B18EB_7B80_41FC_9EB3_58930EDAF01C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫L— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Let go of me!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I-I only came here to work, nothing more!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫放……⟪k:1⟫放开我！⟪k:2⟫我、⟪k:3⟫我不是为了做这种事才来到这里的！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28e7761d5220c16f5174a73f3261b309521805bb46498845589262a6cefcf863
#. default-sha256: a91ee1918391bfbe1fcc4db38cc8107923bd8891ef26d49ac2b922d454c5e97d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9A2A3510_0093_4303_878F_376E620EF135"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The first time I saw you, I thought it would be a tragic waste to leave you to wither away "
"working at some little street-side shop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫第一眼看到你时，⟪k:1⟫还是在大街上。⟪k:2⟫当时我心里就想——⟪k:3⟫要是让你这般美丽的鲜花，就这么枯"
"萎在那种地方，⟪k:4⟫那可真是打心底里叫人可惜啊。"

