"⟪k:0⟫But when I did that, he would send another abigail to come find me the next day. ⟪k:1⟫I "
"couldn’t ignore his summons when he got other people involved."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫隔天，⟪k:1⟫另一个的侍女唤来了我。⟪k:2⟫……既然是其他人的招呼，⟪k:3⟫我无法视而不见。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_886D2DFD_942B_4BA8_8FC0_A072A7886AE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44fe7281e5d40a9d247d8a90a71dfb792f1b4939db0220c889d24671d2734ca4
#. default-sha256: 6e1f4e32149f25472dcb257fc9dabad9ba5562f4e537f8f953ecf3bd90cc73de
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_886D2DFD_942B_4BA8_8FC0_A072A7886AE7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then, when the two of us were alone, the mask would come off,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而后，⟪k:1⟫那个男人趁只有我和他两人独处的时候，⟪k:2⟫突然原形毕露——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D11C88CF_C171_4381_9450_5E6279F4AF97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 036579ba000d266b9d59bb8705eb5c245a5cf67f5b5e505374942714ad6801e3
#. default-sha256: 14368e10195d5fba79ab55731b39918c4e118f672c41042a2df90c5ef796ed11
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D11C88CF_C171_4381_9450_5E6279F4AF97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and he would “discipline” me for not showing up before taking care of his usual business."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在对我上下其手前，⟪k:1⟫他目露凶色地怒吼道——「为什么没有来！」⟪k:2⟫随即将我一顿毒打。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_487321FA_69B5_4FF3_82F3_19BF5A231845
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2bc27990838eaeee21b713c97df8f5410764033c1cbf8055bfdc0f5a40fd050
#. default-sha256: b7196f22fdeebbdfb9a72c55f30e292a85e207274cf8521ebddf4bce191311ba
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_487321FA_69B5_4FF3_82F3_19BF5A231845"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On good days, he would leave bruises in inconspicuous places—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫my abdomen, my "
"inner thighs..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那些伤痕留在了身体并不显眼的地方——⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫比如下腹部、⟪k:3⟫大腿内侧等等……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5CE5A523_0BAA_4371_83D5_B334F54E9CD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3224e06715d2031e29f7dc8c01b16206f8f7a2d671c9af938da0c7585255cb7b
#. default-sha256: 7455d20c753c6f77d0d7fe20e2b1d318c62fe602769aeb760cbf67e06a86de07
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5CE5A523_0BAA_4371_83D5_B334F54E9CD3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but he went as far as carving a word into my skin with a knife:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫最过分时，⟪k:1⟫他甚至用小刀，⟪k:2⟫在我的皮肤上刻下文字。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6F64A8B0_4922_4A72_AD3B_624686998328
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3cb6313e80036d5a2e40f59fe8462c9e361e930fa8bd34afe019aed1abd530b
#. default-sha256: d2866e8eee347086c00a731f3c63f87fe4cd58b945de23e18f024071cd8ce864
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6F64A8B0_4922_4A72_AD3B_624686998328"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“HARLOT”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫例如——「妓女」。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E1C46550_37FA_410B_99C4_9B80A3380C52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3420a0bfc557022cd675bb14214753027e47e1f1bb583da1c9a721d10eabe465
#. default-sha256: 734ed69cb73306513f08717c56360e868734a8750313880251e920584f09b0aa
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E1C46550_37FA_410B_99C4_9B80A3380C52"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was why I was afraid of knives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以，⟪k:1⟫我……很害怕刀具。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E6E9EE2F_B390_4656_B00F_C3A012929933
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcdcc2032b01df11c516f77e5450738ad0430f4212a843454b9aa04ae8fd5e8a
#. default-sha256: b490f11f4970c138380ff4f74d5d1622e33caeada1672d084f3a2e155365162e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E6E9EE2F_B390_4656_B00F_C3A012929933"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was why I was afraid of men shouting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以，⟪k:1⟫我……很害怕男人的吼声。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9195DB89_6797_4324_B511_9CEC5DAD8063
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 599e87f3a54cec53a1fbed11e9553af10e5ee7e017d2654819fa801436d1aecc
#. default-sha256: 6c278398e57289ee2771fb645c6f29e1bbcfb0cfc5947355f1757fa6d88f8fc5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9195DB89_6797_4324_B511_9CEC5DAD8063"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t even sure what to regret anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……我甚至已经不明白，⟪k:1⟫该后悔些什么才好。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_43B1A0FA_A5F5_4560_A2D9_68B226FC7D80
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc1314036e30d85501d44d100ced687c314d9ddb84c3968e29c781d3878fffff
#. default-sha256: 6e677c610ef2b7b3eca96d869b045e42daf0601f755d00adc4364aca67fa60f5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_43B1A0FA_A5F5_4560_A2D9_68B226FC7D80"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was in far too deep. ⟪k:1⟫There was no turning back the clock."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫到了这种地步，⟪k:1⟫已经没办法再回头了。⟪k:2⟫只能流逝的时间，⟪k:3⟫无法倒退。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9715B063_124D_411D_A32D_39BDFE2EB060
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5621ad19b73ec067bd57016bd7cf2c8ff3ae81285abad07e503f2708d45d314b
#. default-sha256: 952f02d09778dfc3194cb693e2eec194bc1ea6682ed31baeb9dc2908967d328d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9715B063_124D_411D_A32D_39BDFE2EB060"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even considered taking my own life on more than one occasion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我曾想过，⟪k:1⟫干脆死了，就能一了百了。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7E283FE5_63BE_4AA5_AE0C_A33689D95472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff8ea77d635e650dd933c2f338bf2da9b52e1af1c12285c586e901734cf65242
#. default-sha256: b54d580eb2d7b2427bee9dfbcb455a0596cf1ce6d79d4193085e3456c8d8ad9d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7E283FE5_63BE_4AA5_AE0C_A33689D95472"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every time the thought crossed my mind, happy memories came with it. ⟪k:1⟫Back when it "
"was just the three of us girls and the shop.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Life may not have been easy, but it was "
"never dull either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但每当这时，⟪k:1⟫过去快乐的回忆都会在脑海中复苏——⟪k:2⟫即使生活艰苦，⟪k:3⟫但和母亲、还有姐姐，"
"⟪k:4⟫三人一起热热闹闹地生活着的那些日子。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_12D5D2EE_6477_4AA3_9995_C3BD3F5831CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a83fb0e718b4e31672c2eb7298cb2af46e561faadaff9f6e196648cd565fbd48
#. default-sha256: 9a0b121bc1073759832e56865be9cf4451ab0548692135c8beec1b5a65d94f90
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_12D5D2EE_6477_4AA3_9995_C3BD3F5831CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t want to end my life at its absolute lowest point."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……所以，就算是如此处境险恶、⟪k:1⟫就算心灵枯竭、⟪k:2⟫就算情绪绝望……⟪k:3⟫我也不想轻生。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD06AF7E_2560_45F2_944E_1B58C87617FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edce0222244ff61d63cbe236e9ede7f30a198ee2cd4a5db03fa48876e6789aaf
#. default-sha256: f02669fd398909b672068b44e0d5885edd6c70ee1316e3d8f3219767864d6899
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD06AF7E_2560_45F2_944E_1B58C87617FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted, if just temporarily,⟪k:1⟫to go back to the way things were back then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「再一次——只有一次也好。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我想要回到那和平、⟪k:3⟫幸福的每一天……」"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5076E858_BDAB_43D6_A3FC_A3D71291F331
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e56b1e3d3e8fb15c99c9059dbb1b1fe8ac82860f6bf5a3a9c05567e1035aebc
#. default-sha256: 50c5f480dc478df0d1d63be593ebc54cae2b689948a741dc17d4e46fd58838ac
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5076E858_BDAB_43D6_A3FC_A3D71291F331"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That objective was the only thing that allowed me to keep going."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫正是这份信念，⟪k:1⟫支撑着我忍受住在博林杰家的每一天。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C06E73D9_3101_4E8A_B88B_AF079759DA99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c86f611b565174c36c2e5f80379fecd5951fab81acbcd5d611ae4d7a1b54a103
#. default-sha256: 7dbe854301f046d808c74fb62fe84cee573fcb9186c5e8da9559872b001ac190
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C06E73D9_3101_4E8A_B88B_AF079759DA99"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When I was in his presence, I tried to convince myself I was merely an object.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I "
"had no emotions, so he couldn’t hurt me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫在那个男人面前，⟪k:1⟫我就把自己想做是一件物品。⟪k:2⟫只要丢弃掉所有感情，⟪k:3⟫就不会受到伤害。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2B02D1E2_4760_41EA_A31F_5E9954ACB823
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4316d05025775fdbe53e59950f16fc7b0ce2a001b1408292cb0c982999539a2
#. default-sha256: 5bfbb6e6a72604d718b3f5b0ebb251adc7fdfec29f42b07043f7924c7961525b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2B02D1E2_4760_41EA_A31F_5E9954ACB823"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His hands couldn’t reach my heart,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我只是个容器。⟪k:1⟫我只是团肉块。⟪k:2⟫那个男人能得到我的身体，⟪k:3⟫但得不到我的心。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F7E4BD27_0335_40CB_B922_23CF301116D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3590d4d8efe0cc511c249e20adbc19a0462d42a5027fad2ebcd1806d1f38f5b9
#. default-sha256: ff5d257871ef7602dec2a8d865d2fd709c07f6667e70a8a51b6d54116722d5f2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F7E4BD27_0335_40CB_B922_23CF301116D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for it was not connected to my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我的身体和心，⟪k:1⟫早已分离。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CB63FF7A_0A1D_4306_85E6_F190B75C2889
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d94afa3b688a906a0b0b2615c4e7f9f48e044843ee67c4ebacc53ee47168fae
#. default-sha256: 37efd0446752f3d8f9ce7443bd8cb3ec4c8d87b5ab1f2eda87db5d064dcf464b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CB63FF7A_0A1D_4306_85E6_F190B75C2889"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doing that made it a little easier to bear,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在这样说服自己的过程中，⟪k:1⟫我轻松了许多。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BD46EAB8_8A67_4B7B_99A7_D121E318BF44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9080ca553d2465a4fe4a0d10da9cabac49de59ac15506abd282e48f3a831594
#. default-sha256: 245909cae504ed015d8d6202a139567e1dd2a980922f0fb24d4d6ad7fb98089c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BD46EAB8_8A67_4B7B_99A7_D121E318BF44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but the reality was, it was impossible to completely sever my heart from my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但，⟪k:1⟫让身心完全分离这种事，⟪k:2⟫其实……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫根本做不到……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A71F91C_EF9C_4C00_9A8B_C5595B2028FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d759386f7cc212a4d2da691176fa64e845c6e8016a8fe0cf0ac44d8cd4148d17
#. default-sha256: 277719b0d2f7246272a94a22cee53100b9a627087c2c0149f161b126d66896bd
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A71F91C_EF9C_4C00_9A8B_C5595B2028FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’re Giselle, aren’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫——你是吉赛儿吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DF037EBD_D86C_45CA_9C5F_83A724E96A00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 007885640c39affec440ce25174f25df18e0299b5282e8061ca2a83f0515510c
#. default-sha256: 66d64c19597e9b1fdeb2d0eb6f09ab189857404f3908bfed893e6f57dc828c01
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DF037EBD_D86C_45CA_9C5F_83A724E96A00"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫One day, the mistress of the estate stopped me in the halls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫某日，⟪k:1⟫博林杰家的夫人突然在屋子的走廊下叫住了我。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7CAECF07_8336_4ED7_B3F0_227FF0ADDFB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a265851bc4d30d5cc0d4c4679573f47b88b9f7fd7703145954e65f00bad7ad27
#. default-sha256: 9a2a6a29971d1af70f8f510384ca3a5d5a00a0e9d5d54edf0841c8c046b81d20
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7CAECF07_8336_4ED7_B3F0_227FF0ADDFB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, supposedly, once been quite beautiful, but now she was only haggard and bony."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫她年轻时应该是个一位佳丽，但现在，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫在那张憔悴的脸上，⟪k:3⟫找不到一丝往日容颜的影子。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EB611ACB_B35D_4124_8B3B_C13FE06A9AA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 323f74bbc7e0e237730206baab91d4553f5f921284b66c726120e643e9c81732
#. default-sha256: 8553c35723c35cfc148f01fed797d9387d1e5a0c08b82a4031403f0086e15eba
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EB611ACB_B35D_4124_8B3B_C13FE06A9AA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her skin dry, her eyes sunken, her hair faded and stripped of its luster, her head down, her "
"cracked lips barely moving as she spoke."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫干燥的皮肤、⟪k:1⟫深陷的眼窝、⟪k:2⟫光泽褪去的金发、⟪k:3⟫痀偻的身姿、⟪k:4⟫生裂的嘴唇只能发出阴"
"霾的声音。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_126DFA18_91A2_4506_8DF7_0D01694C541B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4dd10955572b2da74942d302a83d7848b450fd5417538fa06bc8aad185a06d10
#. default-sha256: 0b6c1308a3fec6bae65e45f2e8c73648df4e4a15487f9405e9d9a0089b51827c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_126DFA18_91A2_4506_8DF7_0D01694C541B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Age didn’t appear to be the only thing working its merciless magic on her either. ⟪k:1⟫There "
"seemed to be something eating away at her from the inside too—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫something that could "
"burst at the lightest touch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫会变成这样，⟪k:1⟫并不只是年事已高的缘故——⟪k:2⟫还有某种让人不寒而栗的东西，从她身体内部，由内"
"而外地腐蚀了她的身心，⟪k:3⟫我能如此感觉到。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_203C88F6_A774_415E_ACC7_2EB551047818
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d6f6541e82e2e8ddfdc1bd33e641b8b250f7b1703f1370956932e012f3e4da4
#. default-sha256: f768af7d3491da5c611a2c2f66851cb93e7d847661259066c77505d2edbcfbe7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_203C88F6_A774_415E_ACC7_2EB551047818"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Yes, I am Giselle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is there something I can do for you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是、⟪k:1⟫是的……我就是吉赛儿，⟪k:2⟫请问夫人有何吩咐……？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_616B69F6_7C21_449D_98FE_D1F2A65961D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c1a8a48809803fa95a53fd8485084bbbed2840c530208031064443cd851b27a
#. default-sha256: 2b72541585f94c56f744142f103759c20c3a845ad3ffc31023f536ee455a9636
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_616B69F6_7C21_449D_98FE_D1F2A65961D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mistress rarely ever left her chambers. ⟪k:1⟫I had been told it had been years since she "
"attended family supper."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫——我几乎从未见夫人从她自己的房间里出来过。⟪k:1⟫况且，⟪k:2⟫她似乎很多年没有与家族共进晚餐了。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A591642B_1E4F_4B0D_B02F_544E1C8F0642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 314b688a20e1849ec8b884e3da9c0d7ba42176bbddc4ae5c14fd449debdee1a5
#. default-sha256: 2fc22ac9f9046a700c59a90f65bd0b14400f0215c78a42861206784d7770e466
